      "question": "Consider the following statement and choose the option that follows. Statement: The railway authority decided to reduce ticket prices on long-distance trains. Assumptions: I. Lower prices will attract more passengers. II. The authority wants to compete with airlines.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Consider the following statement and choose the option that follows.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: The railway authority decided to reduce ticket prices on long-distance trains.</p>\n\n<p>Assumptions:</p>\n\n<p>I. Lower prices will attract more passengers.</p>\n\n<p>II. The authority wants to compete with airlines.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I is implicit",
          "html": "Only I is implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II is implicit",
          "html": "Only II is implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both are implicit",
          "html": "Both are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither is implicit",
          "html": "Neither is implicit"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Assumption I:</span> Lower prices will attract more passengers. ✔ (Reason for reducing prices)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Assumption II:</span> The authority wants to compete with airlines. ✖ (Not mentioned or necessary).</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Only I is implicit.</span></p>\n",
