      "question": "Consider the following statement and choose the option that follows. Statements: I. Banks have increased staff training on cyber security. II. There has been a surge in cyber attacks.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Consider the following statement and choose the option that follows.</p>\n\n<p>Statements:</p>\n\n<p>I. Banks have increased staff training on cyber security.</p>\n\n<p>II. There has been a surge in cyber attacks.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "I is the cause and II is the effect.",
          "html": "I is the cause and II is the effect."
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "II is the cause and I is the effect.",
          "html": "II is the cause and I is the effect."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both are unrelated.",
          "html": "Both are unrelated."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "No relation.",
          "html": "No relation."
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">If cyber attacks increase, banks will respond by improving cyber security training for their staff.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">∴ Correct option:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">II is the cause and I is the effect.</span></p>\n",
