      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e24128f27c83-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Find the WRONG term in the given series. 5, 10, 15, 26, 37, 50",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Find the WRONG term in the given series.</p>\n\n<p>5, 10, 15, 26, 37, 50</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "50",
          "html": "50"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "26",
          "html": "26"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "15",
          "html": "15"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">n = 2 ⇒ 2<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1 = 4 + 1 = 5</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 3<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1 = 9 + 1 = 10</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 4<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1 = 16 + 1 = 17 (Instead of 15)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 5<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1 = 25 + 1 = 26</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 6<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1 = 36 + 1 = 37</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 7<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">∴ The wrong term is 15.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
