    {
      "id": "e24128f27c83-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "Which two signs should be swapped to correct the following? 28 &divide; 4 &times; 3 - 5 + 7 = 19",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which two signs should be swapped to correct the following?</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">28 &divide; 4 &times; 3 - 5 + 7 = 19</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "&divide; and &times;",
          "html": "&divide; and &times;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "&times; and -",
          "html": "&times; and -"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "&divide; and +",
          "html": "&divide; and +"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "+ and -",
          "html": "+ and -"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Swap − and + :</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">28 ÷ 4 × 3 + 5 − 7</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">28 ÷ 4 = 7</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">7 × 3 = 21</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">21 + 5 − 7 = 19 ✔</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">∴ The correct signs to swap are <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">− and +</span>.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e24128f27c83-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "By interchanging the given two signs which of the following equation will be NOT correct? + and - I. 18 &divide; 3 + 8 &times; 5 - 4 = 20 II. 6 + 8 &times; 9 &divide; 3 - 4 = 14",
      "questionHtml": "<p>By interchanging the given two signs which of the following equation will be NOT correct?</p>\n\n<p>+ and -</p>\n\n<p>I. 18 &divide; 3 + 8 &times; 5 - 4 = 20</p>\n\n<p>II. 6 + 8 &times; 9 &divide; 3 - 4 = 14</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Neither I nor II",
          "html": "Neither I nor II"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Both I and II",
          "html": "Both I and II"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Only II",
          "html": "Only II"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only I",
          "html": "Only I"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Interchange + and −</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. 18 ÷ 3 + 8 × 5 - 4 = 20</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">18 ÷ 3</span></u> − <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">8 × 5</span></u> + 4 = 20</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">6 - <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">40 + 4</span></u> = 20</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">6 − 44 = 20</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">- 38 ≠ 20</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. 6 + 8 × 9 ÷ 3 - 4 = 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">6 − <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">8 × 9 ÷ 3</span></u> + 4 = 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">6 - 24 + 4 = 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">6 - 20 = 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">-14 ≠ 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">∴ Both I and II are NOT correct.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence correct<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> Option 2.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
