          "html": "Only Conclusion II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Conclusion I:</span> The renovation is planned for Sunday.  (This follows because the closure is due to renovation.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Conclusion II:</span> People cannot use the library this Sunday.  (If the library is closed, people cannot use it.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">∴ Both I and II follow.</span></p>\n",
