      "questionHtml": "<p><strong>Instruction</strong>: In a certain code language, Greek letters are used to represent English letters consistently. Using the provided code, decode the target sequence.</p>\n\n<p>If &gamma; &alpha; &lambda; &alpha; &xi; &iota; &alpha; is coded as GALAXIA, &sigma; &tau; &alpha; &rho; is coded as STAR,</p>\n\n<p><strong>Question</strong>: Then what does &sigma; &gamma; &alpha; &lambda; &alpha; represent?</p>\n",
